{'symbol': 'CTAS', 'date': '2022-11-11 10:30:00', 'title': 'CINTAS UNVEILS NEW ESG BRANDING TO ALIGN ITS ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL & GOVERNANCE AMBITIONS', 'text': "CINCINNATI--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TODAY CINTAS CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CTAS) UNVEILED ITS NEW ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) BRANDING IDENTITY, WHICH WAS CREATED TO HELP RAISE AWARENESS AND BRING CONSISTENCY AND COHESION TO CINTAS' ONGOING ESG EFFORTS AND INITIATIVES."}